        "text": "According to Kevin K. Russell (Petitioner), according to Kevin K. Russell (Petitioner), a jury found that at the time petitioner filed a charge with the EEOC, Goodyear paid her less for each week\u2019s work than similarly situated male employees, and did so because of her sex."
